{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of ONLY UP: BRAINROT TOGETHER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main hero <strong>Tung Tung Sahur</strong> and his friends must achieve the impossible \u2014 climb to the top and truly reach the peak. But the path upward won\u2019t be easy: at every step, they\u2019ll be hunted by chaotic creatures \u2014 <strong>Bombardino Cocodrilo, Spijuniro Golubiro</strong>, and others!<br>If you enjoyed games like Peak, RV There Yet?, and other platformers, you\u2019ll feel at home here.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a team of up to <strong>8 players</strong> and dive into a psychedelic ascent where every centimeter is a challenge, and every fallen friend is a source of pure chaotic laughter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906130/extras/8f1308728ff8034c7b0dd3a1c8525371.poster.avif?t=1762356253\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906130/extras/8f1308728ff8034c7b0dd3a1c8525371.webm?t=1762356253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sense of timing, coordination, and mental stability will be put to the test. Levels are built to break even the strongest minds. Every jump and fall is a step toward a personal breakthrough (or breakdown).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906130/extras/5f31af2ed69b433c0aaba9ecee0e85eb.poster.avif?t=1762356253\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906130/extras/5f31af2ed69b433c0aaba9ecee0e85eb.webm?t=1762356253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Climb together! Up to 8 players suffering simultaneously \u2014 the perfect atmosphere of collective madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troll mechanics: Push your friend off the edge and witness the reaction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system: Every time you send an enemy flying off the map, you set your \u201canchor point\u201d and can teleport back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics: Immerse yourself in the acid-soaked brainrot-realms \u2014 the delirium is guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization: The game runs even on a toaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community hub: Join our <strong>Discord</strong> \u2014 talk with the devs and find fellow climbers.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer your inner demons and become a living legend of the climb! Let <strong>Spijuniro Golubiro</strong> and the others tremble at the sound of your name!<br>YAPYAP and ascend!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 2025. All rights reserved.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906130?t=1762356253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906130?t=1762356253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906130/8b5ee512292a5c57aa4d8ec6cb309ee7243003d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762356253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906130/8b5ee512292a5c57aa4d8ec6cb309ee7243003d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762356253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descripti